# RAMP build pins — sourced by build/lib/common.sh (bash).
# Every source tarball: <NAME>_VERSION, <NAME>_URL, <NAME>_SHA256.
# SHA256 provenance (verified 2026-09-24):
#   [pub]  published by upstream (.sha256 file, release JSON, GitHub release asset digest)
#   [calc] upstream publishes none → computed from official tarball, cross-checked as noted
# Do NOT bump a version without updating its SHA256 — fetch() fails hard on mismatch.

# ======================================================================== services
